# Atlas — payroll: cycles, gross-to-net runs, idempotent execution (Sprint 07)
# Login first (see auth.http) and paste the bearer token below.
# Hire at least one worker in the cycle's country first (see workers.http).

@host = http://localhost:5000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Open a monthly pay cycle for Germany (org admin) → 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/cycles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "country": "DEU",
  "frequency": "monthly"
}

### List this org's pay cycles
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/cycles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prepare the run for March 2026 → 201 (computes a payslip per active worker)
# Paste the cycle id from the create response above.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cycleId": "PASTE_CYCLE_ID",
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 3
}

### Prepare the SAME period again → 200, the identical run (idempotent by natural key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cycleId": "PASTE_CYCLE_ID",
  "year": 2026,
  "month": 3
}

### The run with its computed totals and payslip summaries
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit for review (Draft → InReview)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/submit-for-review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve (InReview → Approved)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject instead (InReview → Draft) — sends the run back to be fixed
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Execute (Approved → Executed) — records the run as final; money moves in S09
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Execute again → 200, unchanged (idempotent — re-running is safe)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Execute a Draft run → 422 (authorization follows STATE, not only role)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs/PASTE_DRAFT_RUN_ID/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List runs (org-scoped, cursor pagination as everywhere)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payroll/runs?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One worker's full payslip, every line
GET {{host}}/api/v1/payslips/PASTE_PAYSLIP_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
